# Intentionally minimal. During hermetic Konflux builds, Hermeto's inject-files
# step appends a `registry=file://.../deps/pnpm/npm/` line here so pnpm resolves
# dependencies from the prefetched cache offline (it preserves existing settings).
# Locally this file carries no settings, so pnpm uses its defaults
# (registry.npmjs.org). Do not add developer-specific settings here.
